The petitioner Society, aggrieved by the terms of the tender floated by the second respondent, has filed this writ petition, on the following grounds:-
(i)The respondents ought not to have ventured into the tender during the currency of Election Code of Conduct;
(ii)The earlier tender floated by the respondents have been cancelled unilaterally without assigning any reason and modified the terms of tender.
